<!--''''''-->(Japanese: '''プロローグ''' ''Prologue'') is the prologue chapter of the {{OBP|Anime Pocket Monsters: Liko and Roy's Adventure|manga}} manga. It was first published fully colored in the April 2023 issue of ''[[CoroCoro|CoroCoro Comics]]'', released on March 15, 2023.<ref>[https://web.archive.org/web/20230323041152/https://www.bookshop-ps.com/bsp/bsp_magcode?sha=1&sho=0380904123 ''CoroCoro Comics'' April 2023 issue | Shogakukan BOOK SHOP] (Japanese; archived)</ref><ref>[https://web.archive.org/web/20230315030315/https://corocoro.jp/news/359587/ ''CoroCoro Comics'' April 2023 issue | CoroCoro Comics] (Japanese; archived)</ref><ref>[https://web.archive.org/web/20230315025054/https://corocoro.jp/news/359557/ ''CoroCoro Comics'' April 2023 issue - Pocket Monsters | CoroCoro Comics] (Japanese; archived)</ref><ref>[https://twitter.com/yamadaka_k56/status/1635974134957211649 Kei Yamadaka on Twitter] (Japanese)</ref> It is six pages long.

